# Redirect rules for Cloudflare Pages, translated from upstream esphome.io's
# netlify.toml (Cloudflare Pages reads this flat-file format natively, same
# syntax family as Netlify's own _redirects). See netlify.toml on
# upstream/next for the source of truth this was translated from -- dropped
# from that source: the per-branch (beta/next/production) URL templating (this
# fork has a single branch/deploy target, so /api/* below points at a fixed
# URL), and the /livestream-api/* proxy (the OHF livestream feature was
# removed as part of the EmbedMe rebrand, see the Homepage/Hero.astro commit).
#
# Links to devices.esphome.io / developers.esphome.io / api-docs.esphome.io
# below are deliberately left pointed at ESPHome's own infrastructure --
# EmbedMe has no equivalent of its own to redirect to instead.

# Hugo taxonomy pages - redirect to homepage
/categories/* / 301
/tags/* / 301

/_images/* /images/:splat 301

/esphomeyaml/* /:splat 301

/chat https://discord.gg/BCHEtD4A 301

# API docs redirect
/api/* https://api-docs.esphome.io/:splat 301

# Webserver files
/_static/webserver-v1.* https://oi.esphome.io/v1/webserver-v1.:splat 301

